    "sections": {
        "description": "Welding for Elementor is a dark industrial WordPress theme built for welding workshops, metal fabrication shops, structural steel contractors, ironwork businesses, and heavy manufacturing companies. Compatible with Elementor page builder and Contact Form 7. It has advanced customization that includes full color control for body, header, footer, and blog cards; typography settings for H1–H6 and body fonts; sticky and scroll-aware header with size control; footer layout with 1–4 column selection; blog display in list, grid, or masonry style; reading progress bar; custom scrollbar; preloader; and back-to-top button. Fully responsive, fast-loading, and SEO-ready with clean semantic HTML5. Ideal for welding services, fabrication workshops, metalwork contractors, industrial repair businesses, pipework companies, and engineering firms seeking a professional, high-impact web presence."
    },
